    "On Wall Street, New York Stock Exchange officials say they are unsure how much longer they can keep the securities and commodity markets open, as chaos and civil disorder spread, and even the wealthy and wellconnected Wall Street firms and stock exchanges are finding it difficult to buy fuel at any price, to keep their generators and computers running. In the mean time, stock prices continue to plummet as havoc reigns and anarchy grows, with no end in sight.": "",
    ". The enormously sophisticated Egregious system, supposedly capable of simultaneously tracking and directing defenses against thousands of incoming enemy ship-killing missiles at one time, proved unable to \"see\" anything moving at more than 400 mph.  Thus it shot down nothing but our own planes, as they took off from carriers. Apparently the Navy/s decision to acquire the Egregious system was heavily influenced by \"grease\" payments to key Navy officials....": "",
    "The real question, simply put, therefore, is whether we will disclose the fact that we have found a truly miraculous natural cure for cancer (which will have a disastrous effect on our sales of NuToxin if we disclose our findings). Or, do we suppress the research findings and simply announce that the rainforest herbs we have been testing for years have shown no promise as cancer treatments and that we have abandoned any further research along those lines?": "",
