    "We have just discovered that a small amount of putrid meat got mixed into a very large batch of our packaged food products, which will probably cause some degree of health risk to to a few dozen customers, as we have discovered the putrid meat was not only somewhat rotten, but contained \"prions,\" a dangerous protein that is responsible for \"Mad Cow Disease\" and similar ill effects in humans, and even in deer, elk and other animals in the wild or on farms.": "",
    "A brilliant piece of investigative journalism by a reporter at a small newspaper--no major daily would touch the story-- has defeated a cynical effort by a major corporation to block passage of the environmental cleanup of nuclear wastes on the Hanford Reservation in the state of Washington. Reportedly, millions of dollars in bribes were paid to key members of Congress to bottle up the bill in their committee for months, all of which bribes were paid by ": "",
